       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PERFORM-VARYING.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 COUNTER-VALUE PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       01 NUMBER-VALUE PIC 99 VALUE 5.
       01 FACTORIAL-VALUE PIC 9(9) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING COUNTER-VALUE FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL COUNTER-VALUE > 5
               DISPLAY "COUNT: " COUNTER-VALUE
           END-PERFORM.
           MOVE 1 TO FACTORIAL-VALUE.
           PERFORM VARYING COUNTER-VALUE FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL COUNTER-VALUE > NUMBER-VALUE
               MULTIPLY COUNTER-VALUE BY FACTORIAL-VALUE
           END-PERFORM.
           DISPLAY "FACTORIAL: " FACTORIAL-VALUE.
           STOP RUN.
